弗及。田仲已死，而雒陽有劇孟。周人以商賈為資，而劇孟以任俠顯諸侯。吳楚反時，條侯為太尉，乘傳車將至河南，得劇孟，喜曰：「吳楚舉大事而不求孟，吾知其無能為已矣。」天下騷動，宰相得之若得一敵國云。劇孟行大類朱家，而好博，多少年之戲。然劇孟母死，自遠方送喪蓋千乘。及劇孟死，家無餘十金之財。而符離人王孟亦以俠稱江淮之間。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"劇孟母"},"interpretation_note":"依明示稱謂及段內敘事記錄；未名者不補姓名，不推同母、排行或婚姻。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-shiji124-006","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","event_type":"death","status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia","source_id":"s-shiji124-youxia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:p007","quote":"楚田仲以俠聞，喜劍，父事朱家，自以為行弗及。田仲已死，而雒陽有劇孟。周人以商賈為資，而劇孟以任俠顯諸侯。吳楚反時，條侯為太尉，乘傳車將至河南，得劇孟，喜曰：「吳楚舉大事而不求孟，吾知其無能為已矣。」天下騷動，宰相得之若得一敵國云。劇孟行大類朱家，而好博，多少年之戲。然劇孟母死，自遠方送喪蓋千乘。及劇孟死，家無餘十金之財。而符離人王孟亦以俠稱江淮之間。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0031"}],"source_term":"及劇孟死","interpretation_note":"明示死亡敘述連個人與原句；概數及朝代範圍不換算單一年，誅族不據此逐一補造家屬死亡。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m014-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m014-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m014-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m014-0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p014","chapter_