東無足憂者。」至淮陽，問父絳侯故客鄧都尉曰：「策安出？」客曰：「吳兵銳甚，難與爭鋒。楚兵輕，不能久。方今為將軍計，莫若引兵東北壁昌邑，以梁委吳，吳必盡銳攻之。將軍深溝高壘，使輕兵絕淮泗口，塞吳馕道。彼吳梁相敝而糧食竭，乃以全彊制其罷極，破吳必矣。」條侯曰：「善。」從其策，遂堅壁昌邑南，輕兵絕吳馕道。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m012-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m012-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m012-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m012-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"絳侯","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m012-0079","start":79,"end":82,"surface":"鄧都尉","kind":"person","person_id":"g0t_7m5_3bk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m012-0186","start":186,"end":188,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc_C","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","book_id":"b-shiji-106","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:p005","text":"古布衣之俠，靡得而聞已。近世延陵、孟嘗、春申、平原、信陵之徒，皆因王者親屬，藉於有土卿相之富厚，招天下賢者，顯名諸侯，不可謂不賢者矣。比如順風而呼，聲非加疾，其埶激也。至如閭巷之俠，脩行砥名，聲施於天下，莫不稱賢，是為難耳。然儒、墨皆排擯不載。自秦以前，匹夫之俠，湮滅不見，余甚恨之。以余所聞，漢興有朱家、田仲、王公、劇孟、郭解之徒，雖時扞當世之文罔，然其私義廉絜退讓，有足稱者。名不虛立，士不虛附。至如朋黨宗彊比周，設財役貧，豪暴侵淩孤弱，恣欲自快，游俠亦醜之。余悲世俗不察其意，而猥以朱家、郭解等令與暴豪之徒同類而共笑之也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m005-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"延陵","kind":"person","person_id":"9o9_3nf_hyq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m005-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surf